  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the only way to re-use a URI in Fedora is to delete & purge the URI. Then PUT a new object at that URI.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3881"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " we are disallowing this pattern for parts of an Archival Group which prevents the re-use of a URI without deleting the entire object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to consider whether we should and if we do, how we might implement the ability to PUT over a tombstone to recreate the object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Considerations:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "We would need a check to ensure the PUT is understood to be re-creating the object. i.e. some header must be included.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "This PUT would be considered part of the previously deleted object, so there would be no change to interaction model allowed. ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The previous version history of the object would also be maintained.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The previous version history of the object would contain versions where the version was DELETEd and you will get a 410 Gone ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
